   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "选择合适的家具和配件是打造实用小空间的关键。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/23/65/236554693ea9abd217a654b0caf50d46.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/23/65/236554693ea9abd217a654b0caf50d46.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>价格中包含如下组件：</strong></p>\n<p><br /><strong>TARVA 塔瓦</strong> 坐卧两用床&nbsp;<br /><strong>&Aring;DUM 阿达姆</strong> 地毯&nbsp;<br /><strong>NOLMYRA 诺姆拉</strong> 休闲椅&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><strong>NORDEN 诺顿</strong> 桌子&nbsp;<br /><strong>SUNNERSTA 苏纳思</strong> 独立橱柜&nbsp;<br /><strong>8 x SUNNERSTA 苏纳思</strong> 挂杆&nbsp;<br /><strong>6 x SUNNERSTA 苏纳思</strong> 挂钩，5件套&nbsp;<br /><strong>2 x NISSE 尼斯</strong> 折叠椅&nbsp;<br /><strong>BEKV&Auml;M 贝卡姆</strong> 踏脚凳&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><strong>2 x MARIUS 玛留斯</strong> 凳子&nbsp;<br /><strong>&Ouml;RFJ&Auml;LL 奥菲/SPORREN 斯多林</strong> 转椅&nbsp;<br /><strong>2 x HYLLIS"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "选择坐卧两用床，在夜晚可以轻松将客厅变成卧室。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "70231323",
    "s09185363",
    "00343630"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/25/35/25351d9133f95e23586d1a04466c99aa.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/25/35/25351d9133f95e23586d1a04466c99aa.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>非常狭小的住宅可能没有足够的空间摆放沙发，但如果使用坐卧两用床就可以弥补这一缺憾。想睡觉时，只要轻松把它拉出，就拥有了一张双人床。踏脚凳同时还可以用作床头桌，价格实惠的挂杆上可以挂壁灯、闹钟、植物、杂志和配饰，节省大量空间。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "摆上一把休闲椅、一盏阅读灯和一些植物，就可以打造出一个舒适的休息区。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10233607"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ac/5d/ac5dcb67c09b1c9d5ac17ac43c8319f1.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ac/5d/ac5dcb67c09b1c9d5ac17ac43c8319f1.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "挂杆可以用来悬挂闹钟、花盆、阅读灯和杂志，既节省空间，还能让东西收纳整齐。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10303723"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bb/94/bb94f25bc04ec0124dc751432472da67.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/bb/94/bb94f25bc04ec0124dc751432472da67.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "选择坐卧两用床，在夜晚可以轻松将客厅变成卧室。只要拉开就能变成双人床。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "50318628"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/5b/e9/5be908695918e07304918fb3fcba9a9c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/5b/e9/5be908695918e07304918fb3fcba9a9c.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-quote",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Fredrik Biel，室内设计师",
    "如果你一天二十四小时都在同一个空间活动，那么最重要的是，选择的家具要足够灵活，可以满足多种需求。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "使用折叠式餐桌就可以在工作空间、就餐空间和休闲空间之间轻松切换。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40365795",
    "s69162373",
    "80372869"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/11/95/1195249aef0159bcb0b8c468e70733b4.gif"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/11/95/1195249aef0159bcb0b8c468e70733b4.gif",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>说到充分利用小空间，没有什么能比得上 NORDEN 诺顿 折叠式餐桌。支起一个或两个翻板，或者都放下来，就可以轻松选择在这里工作、就餐或者只是放松一下。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "用上大量挂杆、搁板和储物盒，小厨房也能拥有大厨房的所有优点。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "10303723",
    "90303291",
    "60176379"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/3b/e7/3be7dcba1683b610d31658bf524fd508.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/3b/e7/3be7dcba1683b610d31658bf524fd508.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>这个小厨房虽然缺少橱柜空间，但开放式搁板、挂杆和储物盒弥补了这一缺憾。这间极其简约的厨房足以容纳所有必要的厨用物件，无需占用工作室空间。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-quote",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Fredrik Biel，室内设计师",
    "跟这间小厨房一样，运用挂帘或柜门，即可让很容易杂乱不堪的表面变得整洁宁静。"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "如果你的工作室只有一个储物空间，那么选用搁架、储物盒和衣架，即可让它得到充分的利用。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "40343614",
    "30184050",
    "30231631"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/30/f1/30f12e32935da7c67b3b2351b054d970.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/30/f1/30f12e32935da7c67b3b2351b054d970.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>把挂帘拉起来，你就会发现一个特别灵活、精心布置的储物区。两个搁架单元用来放置可折叠的物品和储物盒，而可以悬挂的物品和鞋子放在晒衣架上，并且可以在衣柜里移进移出。上方空间？这块空间非常适合摆放不太常用的季节性物品、床上用品和清洁用品。为了保持整体宁静和谐的氛围，我们为挂帘选择了和墙壁特别搭配的颜色。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "一个小的搁架单元和多个挂钩就可以让衣柜既实用又整洁。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80278579"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/50/53/5053d2ad07334f8d841bace7b1b33800.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/50/53/5053d2ad07334f8d841bace7b1b33800.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "储物盒可以放在搁架单元中，整齐收纳衣柜中的小配饰。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "80192632"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e4/44/e444b8116b353bdcb4ae19c467c6e521.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e4/44/e444b8116b353bdcb4ae19c467c6e521.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "把不常用的物品放在衣柜中更高的搁架上。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/c3/1a/c31ab3796621761d56ee1686ce0fe14a.jpg"
